        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "How might we streamline expense tracking and organization for freelancers and startups so it requires minimal time and effort?"
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "labels": [
            "PROBLEM",
            "SOLUTION"
          ],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Administrative tasks like logging receipts and updating spreadsheets steal valuable hours that could be spent on billable work. Freelancers and small business owners manage multiple responsibilities like client delivery, operations, communication, and finance. Within these competing priorities, capturing and tracking small expenses is often delayed or overlooked."
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [],
          "media": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/assets/images/EB3XRWebdarqtbRBypx1pgQ56dI.jpg",
              "original": "/assets/images/EB3XRWebdarqtbRBypx1pgQ56dI.jpg"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Tally began as an exploration into making financial tracking feel less like traditional bookkeeping and more like a seamless part of daily workflows. Instead of building a full accounting platform, it focuses on a lightweight system that enables independent professionals to quickly capture expenses, organize them by project, and maintain real-time visibility into spending. By automating expense tracking for freelancers and small businesses, Tally eliminates manual data entry. Users can simply upload a receipt image or send a message, and AI extracts, organizes, and securely records the expense in real time."
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Track every expense through its lifecycle"
            }
          ],
          "media": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/assets/images/bN0RpYNeb6Pq4Krp6hTFMfmNQU.jpg",
              "original": "/assets/images/bN0RpYNeb6Pq4Krp6hTFMfmNQU.jpg"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Synced"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Successfully processed and synced to the software. No action needed."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "847"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Expenses this month"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Review"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Flagged for manual review. Usually expenses over $500 or low confidence extractions."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "12"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Need your attention"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Pending"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Currently being processed. Usually completes within seconds of receipt."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "3"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In processing queue"
            }
          ],
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "labels": [],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Surfaces key expense indicators like receipt volume, category breakdown, pending review, and total breakdown so users can quickly understand their financial activity."
            }
