          ],
          "text": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "CuraLink enables structured tracking of medication adherence and health metrics through a streamlined logging interface. The system uses AI-based predictive algorithms to forecast refill needs based on dosage schedules and historical intake, prompting timely user actions. Real-time pharmacy integration pulls live inventory and dynamic pricing data via API from partnered networks, allowing location-based, cost-optimized medication access."
